+  /**
+   * ClutterActor::real-resource-scale-changed:
+   * @actor: a #ClutterActor
+   *
+   * The signal is emitted when the unceiled resource scale of the actor
+   * changes.
+   *
+   * Unlike [signal@Clutter.Actor::resource-scale-changed], this is emitted for
